<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Gutnick's Astro to raise A$7 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Gutnick's Astro to raise A$7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold miner Astro Mining NL plans to raise A$7 million through a placement of 35 million shares at an issue price of 20 cents per share, Astro Chairman and Managing Director Joe Gutnick said on Monday.</p>
<p>Gutnick said in the prospectus for Astro's re-listing that Bell Securities had agreed to underwrite 17.5 million or half of the shares being issued.</p>
<p>Astro's shares last traded in May 1994.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
